Import hang fix:
- Folder import over CIFS (/mnt/valhalla/media/music, 2145 audio files) was a single
  awaited IPC call with no progress/cancel; metadata parse serial (~197-346ms/file
  over SMB) = 7-18 min apparent hang.
- Added progress events (scanning/importing phases + total), cancel (AbortController),
  bounded concurrency (default 4, STATOCYST_IMPORT_CONCURRENCY override), and
  deterministic result ordering.
- Verified: full import completed with progress (test duration 1072s); cancel aborts
  in ~21s and persists partial results.
